WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.900
Your favorite YouTuber is killing pop culture.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:08.000
Whether it's me, MrBeast, The Game Grumps, Binging with Babish, we are all guilty.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.500
In fact, all of YouTube's guilty.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.000
And it's not just on this platform either.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Netflix, Disney+, yeah, them too.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.500
Max, Prime Video, absolutely.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:23.200
When it comes right down to it, on-demand viewing of entertainment has slowly eroded away the very fabric of our collective cultural identity.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:29.400
And whether you realize it or not, that's a key reason why many of you watching right now are suffering from depression.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.600
That's why anxiety levels are on the rise.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:37.200
It's why America is a political hotbed and why so many people are questioning how they fit into the world right now.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.000
It's all because of this.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.100
Behind me are the most expensive cars in the world.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:44.400
My ability to stream MrBeast right now.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.000
Or The Office.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.600
Today, smoking is gonna save lives.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:48.600
Or Avengers.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:50.600
Or Bewitched.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:51.900
Ketchup with my oatmeal.

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:52.800
Or Friends.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:53.900
Or Breaking Bad.

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:55.000
Or Game of Thrones.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.300
Or Game Theory.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:57.400
Or Film Theory.

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:01.424
*Inaudible noises*

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:05.600
Hello, Internet!

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:09.800
Welcome to Film Theory, where we're part of the problem.

