Well, the theme is identity.

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:07.800
It's about being lonely.

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:13.900
It's about finding your place in your relationship with someone else when the identity you thought you had crumbles away.

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:14.800
Huh, go figure.

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:16.200
Kind of matches what we're talking about.

