But there's a recognition out there that talking to real people, telling real stories, and being honest about where we are, it pays off.

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:53.000
While we're in this phase of splintered existence, seek out the real great stories that feel honest to where you are right now.

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:55.700
Don't be afraid to talk about what it's like to be lonely.

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:58.400
